{"seconds": 32.1, "exit": 0, "final": "Excellent! The king on e7 is in check and has no legal moves\u2014it's checkmate.\n\n**Coaching Note:**\n\nThe position after Black's Rxd7 left the Black king on f8 vulnerable. White's queen can deliver a decisive blow by:\n1. **Qh8+** forces the king to e7 (the only legal move)\n2. **Qg7#** is checkmate\u2014the queen controls all escape squares (d6, f6, f8, f7) and the king cannot move\n\nThe key insight: When the enemy king is trapped on the back rank, look for ways to drive it forward into the center where it becomes mated. Here, the pawn on e6 controls d7 and f7, so moving the king away from safety proves fatal.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qh8+\", \"line\": [\"Qh8+\", \"Ke7\", \"Qg7#\"], \"motifs\": [\"mate\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35", "square": "b2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35", "square": "e1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35", "square": "d8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35", "square": "e8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35", "move": "e7+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "3qrk2/3r3p/1p1pP1p1/1PpP4/2P2p2/4b3/1Q4PP/4R2K w - - 0 35", "move": "Qh8+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "3